Package: AURATHOMALAB11
Title: Tests of Hypotheses and Boostrap Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Aura", "Thoma",
      email = "aurathoma@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides custom statistical computing functions for Highest Density Intervals (HDI), Equal-Tailed Intervals (ETI), maximum likelihood estimation (MLE) via grid search, root-finding algorithms, and bootstrap resampling confidence intervals. 
  Also includes an interactive Shiny application for exploring bootstrap distributions. 
